    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Data Authority",
      "items": [
        "Master and Staging Excel workbooks are the sources of truth for building facts",
        "SQLite mirrors building facts and stores CRM, review, session, and audit data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Governance Boundary",
      "items": [
        "AI and employees can propose candidates but cannot write directly to Master",
        "admin or super_admin may approve Staging; only super_admin may approve Master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Answers and Operations",
      "items": [
        "Queries return database facts first; model explanations are optional",
